WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.568
-I love the movie "Parasite."

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:05.204
It is one of the best films
of the year.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:08.374
You directed it and co-wrote
this film.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:11.310
I went in not knowing
what the movie was about

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.846
and just heard buzz
that this was great.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.214
And I loved it.

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:17.316
I loved it, because -- I don't
want to spoil anything.

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:18.217
-Yeah.
-It's hard to describe

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:19.218
the movie.
-Yeah.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.354
How do you describe
"Parasite"?

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:26.425
-[ Speaking Korean ]

00:00:26.425 --> 00:00:28.560
-I'd like to say
as little as possible here,

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.397
because the film is best when
you go into the cold.

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:32.865
[ Light laughter ]
-Anyway --

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:34.300
Well, this is a talk show.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.103
-So, you have to say
something.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.371
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:43.542
-[ Speaking Korean ]

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:45.811
-It's a story
about a family.

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:48.347
The son goes into a rich house
as a tutor

00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:50.283
and the story unfolds
from there.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.618
-Just knock out performance.
You just -- oh.

00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:56.923
You feel sad for them, and then
they make you laugh.

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:59.125
-Yeah.
-And then they're in trouble.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.728
And you go, "Oh -- Oh, don't.
This is bad."

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.229
I mean, seriously, that you go
through all of these --

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.530
-Yeah.
-And then that's just the first,

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.365
kind of, half.
-They're all very human.

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:08.768
Yeah. It's just funny
and scary movie.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:10.670
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.372
[ Applause ]

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.607
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.776
"Parasite" won the grand prize,
the Palme d'Or

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.912
at the Cannes Film Festival.
This is --

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:22.048
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:25.217
It was the first --
It was the first Korean film

00:01:25.217 --> 00:01:26.786
to receive the award.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:29.722
And you were the first Korean
director to win the award.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.324
Congratulations on that.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:36.095
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:37.730
Here's what made me laugh.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.633
I read that it got an
eight-minute standing ovation

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:41.868
for the film.
-Yeah.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.136
-Eight minutes of people
clapping.

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:45.772
And then you got up and all you
said was,

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.607
"Thank you.
Let's all go home."

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.809
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:51.777
What happened?
Why?

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:56.515
-'Cause actually the screening
was very late night,

00:01:56.515 --> 00:01:59.785
it was almost midnight and --

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:03.156
[ Speaking Korean ]

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.195
-So the standing ovation
lasted very long.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.130
But the actors and I
were very hungry,

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.332
because we couldn't eat dinner.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:16.202
-So, actually,
me and the actors --

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:20.473
[ Speaking Korean ]

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.841
"I'm so hungry."

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.310
-We all were saying to each
other, "We're so hungry."

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.446
And they ended up subtitling it
in the video that was later.

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:28.615
-No, no.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:29.949
-But applause never stopped.

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:33.086
So, finally I said,
"Let's go home."

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:34.654
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:35.921
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.921 --> 00:02:37.090
-I think that's great.

